\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Empirical stylized facts of SPY daily excess growth rates (2014--2024). Panel\nonbreakingspace (a) shows the leptokurtic marginal distribution; the Laplace fit substantially outperforms the Gaussian. Panel\nonbreakingspace (b) confirms heavy tails via a normal quantile-quantile (Q-Q) plot. Panels\nonbreakingspace (c) and\nonbreakingspace (d) contrast the near-zero autocorrelation of raw returns (consistent with the efficient markets hypothesis) against the persistent autocorrelation of absolute returns, motivating the jump-duration extension.}}{3}{figure.caption.2}\protected@file@percent }
