\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {S5}{\ignorespaces Simulated price trajectories under three dependence specifications (all starting at \$100). (a)\nonbreakingspace Independent HMM marginals: drawdowns and rallies occur at unrelated times. (b)\nonbreakingspace Single-Index Model: partial co-movement via the market factor. (c)\nonbreakingspace Student-t copula: crash episodes synchronize because the copula reorders each asset's independently simulated values so that extreme days coincide. Panels\nonbreakingspace (a) and\nonbreakingspace (c) use the same growth rate values; only the temporal ordering differs.}}{S-15}{figure.caption.49}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:price_trajectories}{{S5}{S-15}{Simulated price trajectories under three dependence specifications (all starting at \$100). (a)~Independent HMM marginals: drawdowns and rallies occur at unrelated times. (b)~Single-Index Model: partial co-movement via the market factor. (c)~Student-t copula: crash episodes synchronize because the copula reorders each asset's independently simulated values so that extreme days coincide. Panels~(a) and~(c) use the same growth rate values; only the temporal ordering differs}{figure.caption.49}{}}
